    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Tap your profile icon in the top-right corner and select "Change Learning Language" from the dropdown menu. Choose your preferred language and you'll be taken back to your content.
    </p>

